<form name="_newscontent_fromname">
        <div class="con_bt">Nature∣ 周沛劼与合作者提出构建蛋白质组虚拟细胞新方法</div>     
        <div class="con_ly">
            <span>发布时间：2026-09-12</span>
            <span>点击：<script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 2135844624, 20361)</script></span>
        </div>
